  "details": "My idea is to add a button to the camera that expands the camera image to the full screen. Plus there was a button that turns off the interface. Thus the camera image is displayed on the screen and it will be possible to control it by pressing the middle mouse button. You can make it so that the exit from this mode was on the esc button. Also we will need a button that switches between pins as a trigger in vr mode. Thus it will be available to stream from the PC from different angles. or just stream with a drone. Also it may be useful for mobile version of vrchat, especially if gyroscope support will be added to it. It will be so that we make a photo in vrchat controlling a real phone and not a touchscreen.",
